  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∀</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> <math><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>z</mi></math>,<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Relation is transitive,<br /><br /><math><mo>∵</mo></math> <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>y</mi></math> does not give <math><mi>y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi></math>,<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Relation is not symmetric.<br /><br />Since,&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi></math> does not hold, hence the relation is not reflexive."
  }
